 while hunger, illness, snipers and hostile scavengers threaten them.\n\nThe Final Cut edition collects every update and free expansion to date, remasters the classic locations and adds a new scenario with a new character, plus extra quests and locations drawn from the Stories DLC. It is a somber single-player survival game in which choices are rarely clean, aimed at players who want to see war from the civilian side."}}